        <activityName xml:lang="en">Gas combined cycle power plant, 400MWe</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Gas combined cycle power plant, 400MWe
New combined cycle power plant of 400MWe class. Data of reference power plant: gas turbine 265MWe, steam turbine 140MWe.;
Synonyms: GuD, GCC; 
UUID: c302aa8d-f0e5-3294-8855-ca6aea53e012
The module includes the most important materials used for construction. It includes also the energy requirements for construction; transport is implicitly included in energy consumption. (Life time for operation assumed 180"000 h.)
Location: Average conditions for European combined cycle plants.
Technology: Best technology. Current gas turbine technology; other parts of power plant from literature 1996.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_c302aa8d-f0e5-3294-8855-ca6aea53e012.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
